    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Creature Type\"><p>当你进行长休时，你需要花费6小时处于一种静止的、非激活的状态，以代替睡眠。这种状态下，你会表现的十分迟缓，但不会失去意识。</p></div><p>When you take a long rest, you spend at least 6 hours in an inactive, motionless state, instead of sleeping. In this state, you appear inert, but you remain conscious.</p>",
